@startuml state_user_level
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Lv1_Beginner
Lv1_Beginner --> Lv2_Learner    : exp >= 100
Lv2_Learner  --> Lv3_Explorer   : exp >= 300
Lv3_Explorer --> Lv4_Challenger : exp >= 700
Lv4_Challenger --> Lv5_Master   : exp >= 1500
Lv5_Master --> Lv5_Master       : continue earning
@enduml
